                                                "sense_id": "30843f0d-c98a-3330-8383-b077180a22b1",
                                                "text": "Wild oats and greenfoxtail are among the most troublesome weeds for farmers growing gramineous crops, such as wheat, barley, rye, triticale and other cereal crops."
                                            }
